  "solution": {
    "text": "The K.E. is always positive.<br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo></math>  The curve C represents the K.E. Both P.E. and total energy are positive but  <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>As P.E. = 2 (Total energy)<br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo></math> B represents the total energy and A represents the P.E.",
